 ldf_tra_init : lateral tracer diffusion
 ~~~~~~~~~~~~ 
    Namelist : namtra_ldf --- lateral mixing parameters (type, direction, coeffi
 cients)
       type :
          no explicit diffusion                   ln_traldf_OFF   =  F
          laplacian operator                      ln_traldf_lap   =  T
          bilaplacian operator                    ln_traldf_blp   =  F
       direction of action :
          iso-level                               ln_traldf_lev   =  F
          horizontal (geopotential)               ln_traldf_hor   =  F
          iso-neutral Madec operator              ln_traldf_iso   =  T
          iso-neutral triad operator              ln_traldf_triad =  F
             use the Method of Stab. Correction   ln_traldf_msc   =  F
             maximum isoppycnal slope             rn_slpmax       = 
  9.9999998E-03
             pure lateral mixing in ML            ln_triad_iso    =  F
             switching triad or not               rn_sw_triad     = 
   1.000000    
             lateral mixing on bottom             ln_botmix_triad =  F
       coefficients :
          type of time-space variation            nn_aht_ijk_t    =           20
             lateral diffusive velocity (if cst)  rn_Ud           = 
  2.7000001E-02  m/s
             lateral diffusive length   (if cst)  rn_Ld           = 
   200000.0      m
 
    ==>>>   Rotated laplacian operator (standard)
 
    ==>>>   eddy diffusivity = F( e1, e2 ) or F( e1^3, e2^3 ) (lap or blp case)
            using a fixed diffusive velocity =   2.7000001E-02 
  m/s   and   Ld = Max(e1,e2)
            maximum reachable coefficient (at the Equator) =    1501.185     
  m2/s  for e1=1°)
 
    ldf_c2d :   aht = Ufac * max(e1,e2)   with Ufac =   1.3500000E-02  m/s
 
