 dyn:vor_een : vorticity term: energy and enstrophy conserving scheme
 ~~~~~~~~~~~
 
 dyn_ldf_blp : bilaplacian operator momentum 
 ~~~~~~~~~~~~
 
 dyn_ldf : iso-level harmonic (laplacian) operator, pass=           1
 ~~~~~~~ 
 
 dyn_ldf : iso-level harmonic (laplacian) operator, pass=           2
 ~~~~~~~ 
 
 dyn:hpg_sco : hydrostatic pressure gradient trend
 ~~~~~~~~~~~   s-coordinate case, OPA original scheme used
 
 dyn_spg_ts : surface pressure gradient trend
 ~~~~~~~~~~   free surface with time splitting
 
 
 div_hor : horizontal velocity divergence 
 ~~~~~~~   
 
 dom_vvl_sf_nxt : compute after scale factors
 ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~
 
 dyn_zdf_imp : vertical momentum diffusion implicit operator
 ~~~~~~~~~~~ 
 
 wzv : now vertical velocity 
 ~~~~~ 
 
 dia_hth : diagnostics of the thermocline depth
 ~~~~~~~ 
 
 
 tra_sbc : TRAcer Surface Boundary Condition
 ~~~~~~~ 
           nit000-1 sbc tracer content field read in the restart file
           read sbc_hc_b (rec:      1) in ./restart.nc ok
           read sbc_sc_b (rec:      1) in ./restart.nc ok
 
 tra_qsr : penetration of the surface solar radiation
 ~~~~~~~
           nit000-1 qsr tracer content forcing field read in the restart file
           read qsr_hc_b (rec:      1) in ./restart.nc ok
 
 trabbl:bbl : Compute bbl velocities and diffusive coefficients in TRA
 ~~~~~~~~~~
 
 tra_adv_fct : FCT advection scheme on TRA
 ~~~~~~~~~~~
 
 tra_ldf_iso : rotated laplacian diffusion operator on TRA
 ~~~~~~~~~~~
 
 tra_zdf : implicit vertical mixing on T & S
 ~~~~~~~ 
 
 tra_nxt : achieve the time stepping by Asselin filter and array swap
 ~~~~~~~
 
 tra_nxt_vvl : time steppingTRA
 ~~~~~~~~~~~
 
 dyn_nxt : time stepping
 ~~~~~~~
 
 ssh_swp : Asselin time filter and swap of sea surface height
 ~~~~~~~ 
 
 dom_vvl_sf_swp : - time filter and swap of scale factors
 ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~   - interpolate scale factors and compute depths for next time s
 tep
 
 stp_ctl : time-stepping control
 ~~~~~~~
      file   : time.step open ok
      unit   =           25
      status = REPLACE
      form   = FORMATTED
      access = SEQUENTIAL
 
